\eta=\frac{F l}{A \Delta l} & =\frac{8 \times 10^3 \times 40 \times 10^{-3}}{\left(40 \times 10^{-3}\right)^2 \times\left(0.1 \times 10^{-3}\right)} \\
& =2 \times 10^9 \mathrm{Nm}^{-2}
